                    Data="M4.5,7.5 L7.6,7.5 L9.1,5 L14.9,5 L16.4,7.5 L19.5,7.5 A2,2 0 0 1 21.5,9.5 L21.5,17.5 A2,2 0 0 1 19.5,19.5 L4.5,19.5 A2,2 0 0 1 2.5,17.5 L2.5,9.5 A2,2 0 0 1 4.5,7.5 Z M12,9.75 A3.5,3.5 0 1 0 12,16.75 A3.5,3.5 0 1 0 12,9.75 Z"/>
